('115.39.c.8.A',3,'A student''s short-term goal is to walk 8,000 steps daily this week, and the long-term goal is to run a 10K in six months. Why track progress?','["To see whether the plan is working and adjust it", "To avoid effort", "To hide results", "To compare to rivals"]'::jsonb,0,'Tracking guides adjustments.','original'),
