('115.39.c.13.B',3,'Bystander training helps reduce bullying because it does what?','["Encourages watching", "Ignores victims", "Blames them", "Teaches students safe ways to speak up and report"]'::jsonb,3,'Bystanders can make a difference.','original'),
('115.39.c.14.A',3,'Substance misuse can affect a teen''s relationships and school performance by doing what?','["Increasing conflict and lowering attendance and grades", "Having no effect", "Improving both", "Raising motivation"]'::jsonb,0,'Misuse disrupts life areas.','original'),
