('115.39.c.17.A',3,'Driving after drinking is dangerous because alcohol does what to a driver?','["Sharpens vision", "Improves focus", "Slows reaction time and impairs judgment", "Speeds reaction"]'::jsonb,2,'Impaired driving causes crashes.','original'),
('115.39.c.17.A',3,'A legal consequence of drinking and driving can be what?','["A discount", "Nothing", "A reward", "License suspension, fines or jail time"]'::jsonb,3,'DWI carries penalties.','original'),
