('115.39.c.22.E',3,'The HPV vaccine is effective at preventing what?','["Colds", "The flu", "Infection with the types of HPV that cause most cervical cancers", "Allergies"]'::jsonb,2,'Vaccination prevents certain cancers.','original'),
